flowchart TD
    Start[Import existing project] --> Auth{Selected provider configured?}
    Auth -- no --> Login[Provider setup or ChatGPT login]
    Login --> Candidate[Inspect only direct parent-level .mod candidates]
    Auth -- yes --> Candidate
    Candidate --> Confirm{Visible confirmation before scan?}
    Confirm -- confirm descriptor --> Scan[Bounded read-only scan]
    Confirm -- scan without descriptor --> Scan
    Confirm -- cancel --> Stop[No scan or project mutation]
    Scan --> Manifest[Approved evidence manifest]
    Manifest --> Provider[Read-only selected-provider semantic analysis]
    Provider --> Findings[Detected, Suggested, Confirmed review]
    Findings --> Components[Component selection]
    Components --> Optional3D[Ask exact 3D workflow question]
    Optional3D --> OptionalSE[Ask exact Super Events workflow question]
    OptionalSE --> DryRun[Dry-run and conflict review]
    DryRun --> Apply[Reversible transaction]
    Apply --> Ready[Readiness report]
